<div class="section-title">

    <h2>
        💻 Technical Interview
    </h2>

    <p>
        Revise the technical fundamentals before your interview.
    </p>

</div>


<div class="accordion" id="technicalQuestions">


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical1">

                01. What is OOP?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical1"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    OOP stands for Object-Oriented Programming.
                    It is a programming approach based on objects
                    and classes.

                </p>

                <p>
                    Four major concepts:
                </p>

                <ul>

                    <li>Encapsulation</li>

                    <li>Inheritance</li>

                    <li>Polymorphism</li>

                    <li>Abstraction</li>

                </ul>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical2">

                02. What is DBMS?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical2"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    DBMS stands for Database Management System.
                    It is software used to store, manage, organize
                    and retrieve data from databases.

                </p>

                <p>

                    Examples include MySQL, Oracle, PostgreSQL
                    and MongoDB.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical3">

                03. What is SQL?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical3"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    SQL stands for Structured Query Language.
                    It is used to communicate with relational
                    databases.

                </p>

                <p>

                    Common commands include SELECT, INSERT,
                    UPDATE and DELETE.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical4">

                04. What is a programming language?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical4"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    A programming language is used by programmers
                    to give instructions to a computer.

                </p>

                <p>

                    Examples include C, C++, Java and Python.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical5">

                05. What is an API?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical5"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    API stands for Application Programming Interface.
                    It allows different software applications to
                    communicate with each other.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical6">

                06. What is the difference between SQL and NoSQL?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical6"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    SQL databases generally use structured,
                    relational tables, while NoSQL databases
                    can use flexible models such as documents,
                    key-value pairs or graphs.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical7">

                07. What is an operating system?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical7"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    An operating system is system software that
                    manages computer hardware and software resources
                    and provides services to applications.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="accordion-item">

        <h2 class="accordion-header">

            <button
                class="accordion-button collapsed"
                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                data-bs-target="#technical8">

                08. What is a computer network?

            </button>

        </h2>


        <div
            id="technical8"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse">

            <div class="accordion-body">

                <strong>Answer:</strong>

                <p>

                    A computer network is a group of connected
                    devices that communicate and share resources.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


</div>


